# Moxa ioLogik R1214.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Moxa ioLogik R1214 Remote RTU I/O — 6-channel DI + 6-channel Relay
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik R1200 Series User Manual V3.2, November 2017 (Appendix)
# | Protocol: Modbus RTU (RS-485); 9600 8N1 default, address configurable via software
# | 
# | DI channels (ch0-5):
# | FC03 addr 0x0000-0x0005 (0-5): DI Mode (0=DI, 1=Counter)
# | FC03 addr 0x0020-0x0025 (32-37): DI filter value ch0-5
# | FC03 addr 0x0040-0x0045 (64-69): DI counter trigger type (0=L2H, 1=H2L, 2=Both)
# | FC04 addr 0x0000-0x0005 (0-5): DI value word ch0-5
# | FC04 addr 0x0020,0x0022...0x002A (32,34,36,38,40,42): DI counter value u32 step-2 pairs
# | FC02 addr 0x0000-0x0005 (0-5): DI bit value ch0-5
# | Relay channels (ch0-5):
# | FC03 addr 0x0140-0x0145 (320-325): Relay value ch0-5
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik R1214
@vendor_website=moxa.com
@description=6-DI + 6-Relay remote RTU I/O, Modbus RTU RS-485 9600 8N1. FC03 DI: DI_Mode ch0-5 (0-5), DI_filterValue ch0-5 (32-37), DI_counterTriggerType ch0-5 (64-69). FC03 Relay: Relay_value ch0-5 (320-325), Relay_pulseOutCount u32 ch0-5 (352,353,...362,363 step-2 pairs), Relay_powerOnDelay ch0-5 (544-549). FC04 DI: DI_value (0-5), DI_counterValue u32 step-2 (32-42). FC04 Relay: Relay_totalCount u32 step-2 (320-330), Relay_userCount u32 step-2 (384-394). FC02: DI_bitValue (0-5). FC01: DI counter ctrl (0-175), Relay ctrl (320-479).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/moxa-iologik-r1214.toml; Source: ioLogik R1200 Series User Manual V3.2, November 2017 (Appendix). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
